# RETIRED 2026-07-19
#
# The Hermes fleet no longer accepts a plaintext bot-tokens.env fan-out file.
# 1Password is the canonical source for Telegram bot tokens, provider API keys,
# webhook secrets, and other static credentials.
#
# Use:
#   docs/15-credential-management.md
#   hermes -p <profile> secrets onepassword set <ENV_VAR> \
#     'op://<vault-id>/<item-id>/<field-id>'
#
# scripts/setup-bots.sh fails closed by design. Do not add real values to this file.
